  "summary": "Trajanic art is the artistic production of the Roman Empire during the reign of Emperor Trajan from 98 to 117.",
  "description": "Trajanic art is the artistic production of the Roman Empire during the reign of Emperor Trajan from 98 to 117. In this period, Roman art further developed the innovations of the Flavian era, coming to definitively detach itself from Hellenistic influence.",
